          "description": "As Presence, plus a general knowledge of the target's actions. In a tactical situation, the caster can declare his actions after learning one of the target's actions for the round (and when he wants to perform the action). This does not prevent the target from changing his action (with the appropriate penalty for cancelling his action, see RMFRP p. 54)."
